{"blocks":[["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4384","Updating the Parent Repo",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4420","After committing changes in submodule, the parent repo doesn't know about the new commit yet",["Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4520","Running git status in the parent repo shows the submodule has changed",["Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4599","Another way this happens: running git pull in the submodule directory to get latest changes",["Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4700","To update the pinned commit in the parent repo:",["Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4755","Run git add <submodule-path> in the parent directory (like any other change)",["02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo","To update the pinned commit in the parent repo:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4842","Commit this change to the parent repo",["02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo","To update the pinned commit in the parent repo:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4888","You're telling the parent repo: change submodule from old commit hash to new commit hash",["02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo","To update the pinned commit in the parent repo:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-4985","After pushing parent repo, the pinned commit changes on GitHub as well",["Video","02:16 Making Changes to Submodules","Updating the Parent Repo"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5063","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5138","Switching Branches with Submodules",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5184","When switching branches in the parent repo, by default Git will not automatically update the submodule",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Switching Branches with Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5298","Example: main branch has submodule pinned to commit A, older branch has it pinned to commit B",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Switching Branches with Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5399","After switching branches, submodule should have old commit checked out, but Git won't do this automatically",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Switching Branches with Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5514","Running git status in parent repo shows Git thinks there are newer commits in submodule",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Switching Branches with Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5611","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5664","To fix this, run: git submodule update",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5712","This moves the submodule state to the pinned commit",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5771","Also necessary when:",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5799","Switching to a branch where submodule didn't exist yet",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)","Also necessary when:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5862","Running git pull in the parent repo",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)","Also necessary when:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-5908","In older versions of Git, you had to run git submodule update after all these operations, which was extremely annoying",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Manual Update Required (Old Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6036","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6094","In newer versions of Git, you can configure automatic updates",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6163","Run these two commands once to enable in your global git config:",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6235","git config --global submodule.recurse true",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)","Run these two commands once to enable in your global git config:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6288","git config --global push.recurseSubmodules on-demand",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)","Run these two commands once to enable in your global git config:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6351","This makes submodules update automatically when you:",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6411","Switch branches",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)","This makes submodules update automatically when you:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6435","Run git pull",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)","This makes submodules update automatically when you:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6458","Run git push",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)","This makes submodules update automatically when you:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6481","Highly recommended: Update Git to latest version before working with submodules",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Auto-Update Configuration (Newer Git Versions)"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6572","Useful Aliases",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6598","Setting up aliases for common operations makes things easier:",["Video","04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Useful Aliases"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6667","git config --global alias.smu \"submodule update --init --recursive\"",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Useful Aliases","Setting up aliases for common operations makes things easier:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6745","git config --global alias.sms \"submodule status\"",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Useful Aliases","Setting up aliases for common operations makes things easier:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6804","git config --global alias.sma \"submodule add\"",["04:04 Branching and Auto-Update Configuration","Useful Aliases","Setting up aliases for common operations makes things easier:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6860","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6926","Adding a Submodule",["Why everyone hates git submodules - YouTube","Video","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-6956","Run: git submodule add <repo-url> <path>",["Video","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7006","This will:",["Video","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7024","Download the submodule repo to the specified directory",["05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule","This will:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7087","Create the .gitmodules file if necessary",["05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule","This will:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7138","Add the new submodule to it",["05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule","This will:"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7174","By default, submodule will be on the latest commit of the default branch (usually main)",["Video","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule"]],["YouTube/%40philomatics/25/05/Why%20everyone%20hates%20git%20submodules/","source-block-7269","To pin it to a different commit:",["Video","05:36 Adding and Removing Submodules","Adding a Submodule"]]],"format_version":5}